Text: Forget Me Not: Reducing Catastrophic Forgetting for Domain Adaptation in Reading Comprehension 1st Ying Xu 2nd Xu Zhong IBM Research Australia IBM Research Australia Melbourne, Australia Melbourne, Australia ying.jo.xu@au1.ibm.com peter.zhong@au1.ibm.com Abstract—The creation of large-scale open domain reading arXiv:1911.00202v3 [cs.CL] 20 Nov 2020 comprehension data sets in recent years has enabled the develop- ment of end-to-end neural comprehension models with promising results.

