Text: To ﬁnd the best hyper-parameter conﬁguration, we tune it based on the development partition for each target domain (and report the performance on the their test partitions). For a given domain, finetune and its variants (+ewc, +ewcn, +cd, +l2 and +all) all share the same hyper-parameter conﬁguration.11 Detailed hyper-parameter settings are given in the supplementary material if requested. As a baseline, we train QANet, decaNLP and BERT from scratch (scratch) using the target domain data.

